Problem 6: Pass or Fail with Retake

Ask for:

Quiz Score
Exam Score

A student passes if:

Quiz score is at least 50 AND
Exam score is at least 50

Otherwise, the student can Retake if either score is 40 or above.

Example:

Quiz: 45
Exam: 70

Retake Allowed

Use:

&&
||


SOURCE CODE


import java.util.*;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
    Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

     System.out.print("Quiz Score ");
     int quiz = sc.nextInt();
     
     System.out.print("Exam Score ");
     int exam = sc.nextInt();
     
     if (quiz >= 50 && exam >= 50) {
         
         System.out.println("Passed!");
         
     }
     else if (quiz >= 40 || exam >= 40) {
         
         System.out.println("Retake Allowed");
     }
     
     else {
         
         System.out.println("Failed");
         
     }

    }
}
